Your Majesty

01:13.640 --> 01:15.040
Your Majesty

01:15.360 --> 01:16.880
Your Majesty, slow down

01:23.640 --> 01:25.720
The 24th year of Yuankang

01:26.000 --> 01:27.480
Emperor Sikong Jing

01:27.560 --> 01:29.600
Due to taking excessive elixirs

01:29.680 --> 01:31.347
And rage affecting his heart

01:31.560 --> 01:33.680
Suddenly passed away

01:34.880 --> 01:36.240
At the same time

01:36.320 --> 01:37.320
Your great army

01:37.400 --> 01:40.720
Had already reached the capital

01:48.120 --> 01:50.240
What did you tell me before?

01:51.560 --> 01:53.960
Saying Qingzhou Army would strike first

01:54.040 --> 01:55.720
Dongming was impregnable

01:55.960 --> 01:56.760
Now?

01:56.880 --> 01:58.880
How did it come to this?

02:02.680 --> 02:04.080
Your Highness

02:04.320 --> 02:05.720
I'll go out personally

02:05.960 --> 02:07.560
Command Qingzhou Army to advance

02:08.600 --> 02:09.840
As long as I'm there

02:09.920 --> 02:11.520
Your Highness's trump card remains

02:14.520 --> 02:15.920
Trump card

02:19.480 --> 02:20.880
Right

02:20.960 --> 02:22.600
His greatest weakness

02:23.640 --> 02:25.307
Is still in my hands

02:28.000 --> 02:29.667
I'll do as you say

02:29.920 --> 02:32.240
I'll find a way to get you out

02:32.320 --> 02:33.480
Remember

02:33.560 --> 02:35.600
Must not make any mistakes

02:44.600 --> 02:45.960
Brother

02:46.040 --> 02:47.440
No matter what

02:47.560 --> 02:49.680
Family is still family

02:50.520 --> 02:53.120
As your elder brother, I won't take advantage

02:53.200 --> 02:54.640
But sending out the Princess Consort

02:54.720 --> 02:56.160
Requires opening the gates

02:56.640 --> 02:58.520
This is too dangerous for me

02:59.440 --> 03:02.040
Order your army to retreat thirty li

03:02.320 --> 03:05.320
I'll send someone to escort the Princess Consort out

03:05.640 --> 03:07.040
But retreating thirty li

03:07.440 --> 03:09.107
We can just come back

03:09.440 --> 03:11.480
Retreat thirty li then return

03:12.000 --> 03:13.120
Back and forth

03:13.200 --> 03:14.840
Will delay at least two days

03:15.000 --> 03:16.040
In that case

03:16.160 --> 03:17.760
Qingzhou Army will catch up

03:18.160 --> 03:19.160
Brother-in-law

03:19.240 --> 03:20.720
As long as we act fast enough

03:20.880 --> 03:21.880
There's still a chance

03:22.000 --> 03:22.920
At that time

03:23.000 --> 03:24.400
I'll lead the vanguard
